    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i think my credit union is trying to liquidate me. they keep hitting me with these weird \"maintenance\" fees that werent there last month and my card keeps getting declined for no reason even when i have the funds. it feels way too coordinated to be random. what can i do to protect my money before they finish forcing me out?",
