      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried calling them but the people on the phone are just reading scripts and acting like nothing is wrong... it's like they're trained to deflect. i don't want to just move my money yet because i feel like if i move it too fast it'll trigger another flag or they'll freeze what's left. are there any specific ways to move funds or set up accounts that stay \"under the radar\" so they don't see the transfer coming and block it?",
