    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but an advisor is just going to tell me the same script they all use. i'm not trying to break rules, i'm trying to prevent them from sabotaging me. if they are intentionally trying to deplete my balance through these fees and blocks, shouldn't i be allowed to use more defensive measures? like, are there ways to fragment my transactions or use secondary accounts so they can't see the full picture of my movement? i just need to get my money out before they lock me out completely.",
